    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="dca92d19-2e67-50f6-a137-e9caf417d640" activityNameId="2d12c96e-bc2e-5fe4-ba9c-e99e899713b0" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Compressor Bitzer</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Compressor Bitzer
This data set describes the production of the a compressor of the Bitzer company from literature source. Data regarding to production (energy use, working materials, waste) stems from company data, requirements of half-finished products from literature. Transport distances are estimated.;
UUID: b5c0e570-3bff-3b7c-bc5d-0686e08a5a5b
This data set describes the production of the a compressor of the Bitzer company including energy use, use of semi-finished products and working materials, waste treatment and transports of components.
Location: This data represent the assembling in Germany.
Technology: Data set for a 7.8 kWth compressor (about 30 kg).
Time period: The literature source from 1999 uses company specific of year 1997 for the requirements by the production, and data from 1996 for the material requirements.
Production volume: na
Sampling: literature 
Extrapolations: production requirements are calculated per kg product
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_b5c0e570-3bff-3b7c-bc5d-0686e08a5a5b.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
      <geography geographyId="948c6fdb-25b0-54ae-bf5c-e320176f724c" geographyContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83">
